SUMMARY:CRWV — Investor Call
DESCRIPTION:Reach out to your dealer to confirm timing and availability\n\n
 Issuer: COREWEAVE INC (CRWV)\nRoadshow: www.netroadshow.com/nrs/home/#!/?s
 how=b0560767 OR Visit www.netroadshow.com and enter the entry code: CoreWe
 ave26 (not case-sensitive)\n\nDeal context:\nCoreWeave\, Inc. is launching
  a dual-tranche senior note offering totaling $3.5 billion equivalent\, co
 mprising USD and EUR tranches with the split TBD\, structured as 6NC3 call
 able bonds with a declining call schedule (50%\, 25%\, par). The deal is r
 ated B1/B/BB- (HY) across both tranches\, with IPT in the high 9s for USD 
 and high 8s for EUR\, and is being led by JPMorgan as B&D with a broad syn
 dicate including Goldman Sachs\, Morgan Stanley\, and MUFG on both tranche
 s\, plus Credit Agricole and Deutsche Bank on the EUR tranche. Proceeds ar
 e designated for general corporate purposes\, with timing set for today's 
 business and an investor call scheduled at 7 AM ET / 12 PM BST.
